        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) When Personal Holiday time in excess of that provided for in Section 10.1.1.c is carried over from one calendar year to the next, at least a like amount of additional Personal Holiday time from the next calendar year must be scheduled and taken no later than the last Sunday in March of the same year. All carried over Personal Holidays and \"matching\" next year Personal Holidays shall be scheduled by January 1st of the new calendar year.",
